Sorry about your troubles Teresa.  If you have deployed your rmd file to shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>, you shouldn't need to worry about versions of R.
Can you send the following information along please?

- The output of shinyapps::showLogs()
- The URL of the deployed RMarkdown doc

I would also try to see if you see the Rmd doc listed in the shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> dashboard and seeing if clicking on the little arrow will take you to the application properly.  I have seen people have capitalization issues because Windows is forgiving of caps, and unix based operating systems are not.

Hope this helps

