So it looks like the version of libcurl that we use on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> (which is just the version that ships with Ubuntu), does not support SFTP.

I'm not sure what we can do about this at this time. To fix it, I guess we would have to build a custom version of libcurl.

Is there another library you can use?

-Andy

